     <p class="coaching-hero-body">If you've seen the four-circle Venn diagram, you've seen a Westernized invention from the 2010s that the Japanese researchers studying ikigai have explicitly disowned. Real ikigai is older, deeper, and far more useful. It's a concept that helps you stop chasing the wrong definition of "successful enough" and start building a life that actually feels like yours.</p>
